 ## Overview
-A single-pass algorithm to traverse voxel grids, using pre-allocated maximum memory to avoid a second pass [S1, unofficial]. It differs from [Grid Traversal (Two-Pass)](12499-grid-traversal-two-pass.md) by allocating buffers large enough for the worst-case scenario upfront, trading memory for a single kernel launch.
